    "Root corrected exact public native client/example routes; positive routes and negative execution/oracle routes tested.",
    "DOM check identified missing explicit status role reflection and direct optional undefined wrapper handling; corrected before executable freeze.",
    "Transient edit quoting syntax failure caught by node syntax check and corrected before successful frozen runs.",
    "Ready crash checkpoints now become interrupted; no HTTP effect is automatically initiated.",
    "Preparation, queued fanout, aggregate outputs, concurrency count and redaction-growth failure checkpoints now have explicit bounds.",
    "Final receipt run initially passed53/54: immediate history read could see running after completed status. Awaiting the persistence queue corrected this real synchronization race; original test assertions stayed unchanged.",
    "Controlled checkpoint probe demonstrated lost Wait cancellation after the earlier 54/54 run; fixed and preserved exact historical source/tests, raw run, and failed observations.",
    "Adjacent queue audit reproduced stale-save rejection leaking into dispose; settled drain tail preserves caller errors while allowing cleanup.",
