irs items using exact original filter extraction and module\nok 50 - native If routes and pairs items using exact original filter extraction and module\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 57.7067\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native manual graph executes native JSON and persists Wait continuation without blocking\nok 51 - native manual graph executes native JSON and persists Wait continuation without blocking\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 2.7252\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native If array/object/any operators and multi-condition combinators match authenticated original helper execution\nok 52 - native If array/object/any operators and multi-condition combinators match authenticated original helper execution\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 52.3128\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native expression, prototype, array growth, structure and semantic option bounds reject before effects\nok 53 - native expression, prototype, array growth, structure and semantic option bounds reject before effects\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 2.249\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native Set include fields preserve own __proto__ data without invoking setters or changing output prototypes\nok 54 - native Set include fields preserve own __proto__ data without invoking setters or changing output prototypes\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 0.6368\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Authenticated original node observations: {\"nodeExecutions\":543,\"parameterResolutions\":1280,\"filterExtractions\":528,\"waitMethodExecutions\":0}\n# Original comparison accounting: {\"exactOutputMatches\":459,\"normalizedHttpOutputMatches\":0,\"rejectionOutcomeMatches\":82,\"deliberateDeviations\":2,\"waitMethodOutputMatches\":0}\n1..54\n# tests 54\n# suites 0\n# pass 53\n# fail 1\n# cancelled 0\n# skipped 0\n# todo 0\n# duration_ms 2534.7684\n",
