4\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: normal cross-origin redirects remove authorization and cookie credentials\nok 26 - normal cross-origin redirects remove authorization and cookie credentials\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 4.8111\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: cancelling a retry delay prevents a second request\nok 27 - cancelling a retry delay prevents a second request\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 25.9555\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: real host routes permit cancellation while a background run waits\nok 28 - real host routes permit cancellation while a background run waits\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 36.145\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native editor imports unknown JSON, preserves metadata on rename/connections, and runs the saved revision through Wait\nok 29 - native editor imports unknown JSON, preserves metadata on rename/connections, and runs the saved revision through Wait\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 584.0996\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native editor rejects stale node selection after replacing JSON instead of modifying a different node\nok 30 - native editor rejects stale node selection after replacing JSON instead of modifying a different node\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 260.7004\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native editor ignores an older asynchronous saved-workflow response when selection changes\nok 31 - native editor ignores an older asynchronous saved-workflow response when selection changes\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 306.2808\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native HTTP node request construction and JSON/text/array/full-response shapes match independently executed exact original module\nok 32 - native HTTP node request construction and JSON/text/array/full-response shapes match independently executed exact original module\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 102.0565\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native HTTP timeout, cancellation, invalid JSON, bad status and response bounds fail against real endpoints\nok 33 - native HTTP timeout, cancellation, invalid JSON, bad status and response bounds fail against real endpoints\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 45.2493\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native and authenticated exact original HTTP module both reject timeout, failed status and invalid explicit JSON\nok 34 - native and authenticated exact original HTTP module both reject timeout, failed status and invalid explicit JSON\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 36.4508\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: source-extracted exact original Wait execute/putToWait methods and released validation helpers establish interval and output contract\nok 35 - source-extracted exact original Wait execute/putToWait methods and released validation helpers establish interval and output contract\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 5.0601\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Authenticated original HTTP/Wait observations: {\"nodeExecutions\":19,\"parameterResolutions\":446,\"filterExtractions\":0,\"waitMethodExecutions\":6}\n# Original comparison accounting: {\"exactOutputMatches\":14,\"normalizedHttpOutputMatches\":2,\"rejectionOutcomeMatches\":3,\"deliberateDeviations\":0,\"waitMethodOutputMatches\":6}\n# Subtest: native app HTTP saves exact imported metadata and revisions across restart and refuses stale edits\nok 36 - native app HTTP saves exact imported metadata and revisions across restart and refuses stale edits\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 150.7758\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native Wait persists real continuation, resumes after restart API bootstrap, and performs its downstream HTTP effect once\nok 37 - native Wait persists real continuation, resumes after restart API bootstrap, and performs its downstream HTTP effect once\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 304.7497\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native durable wait cancellation persists and prevents later effects, including restart\nok 38 - native durable wait cancellation persists and prevents later effects, including restart\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 143.5126\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native active HTTP cancellation and host shutdown record distinct failure traces without automatic replay\nok 39 - native active HTTP cancellation and host shutdown record distinct failure traces without automatic replay\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 98.8606\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native failed HTTP status records node/code trace; known unsupported downstream config preflights before requests\nok 40 - native failed HTTP status records node/code trace; known unsupported downstream config preflights before requests\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 55.5069\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native restart rejects malformed durable continuation before any downstream effects\nok 41 - native restart rejects malformed durable continuation before any downstream effects\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 24.2365\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native item/request/array/aggregate preparation bounds reject without issuing partial HTTP effects\nok 42 - native item/request/array/aggregate preparation bounds reject without issuing partial HTTP effects\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 29.4603\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native public actions capture caller input before awaits and returned records cannot mutate shared MemoryStore state\nok 43 - native public actions capture caller input before awaits and returned records cannot mutate shared MemoryStore state\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 1.7057\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: host serves only native public editor/example modules while execution and oracle modules remain private\nok 44 - host serves only native public editor/example modules while execution and oracle modules remain private\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 26.8132\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native caps concurrent running/waiting continuations at sixteen and cancellation releases capacity\nok 45 - native caps concurrent running/waiting continuations at sixteen and cancellation releases capacity\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 21.9321\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native restart classifies a ready checkpoint as interrupted and does not initiate its HTTP request\nok 46 - native restart classifies a ready checkpoint as interrupted and does not initiate its HTTP request\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 35.6537\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native workflow JSON preserves unknown nodes, metadata, options and non-main connections while preflight refuses unsupported execution\nok 47 - native workflow JSON preserves unknown nodes, metadata, options and non-main connections while preflight refuses unsupported execution\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 2.2572\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native Manual Trigger executes the authenticated exact original node contract\nok 48 - native Manual Trigger executes the authenticated exact original node contract\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 0.8697\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native Set modern assignments, conversions, include selection/exclusion, dot notation and expressions match exact original module\nok 49 - native Set modern assignments, conversions, include selection/exclusion, dot notation and expressions match exact original module\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 48.3266\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native If routes and pairs items using exact original filter extraction and module\nok 50 - native If routes and pairs items using exact original filter extraction and module\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 70.9514\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native manual graph executes native JSON and persists Wait continuation without blocking\nok 51 - native manual graph executes native JSON and persists Wait continuation without blocking\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 2.595\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native If array/object/any operators and multi-condition combinators match authenticated original helper execution\nok 52 - native If array/object/any operators and multi-condition combinators match authenticated original helper execution\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 46.0719\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native expression, prototype, array growth, structure and semantic option bounds reject before effects\nok 53 - native expression, prototype, array growth, structure and semantic option bounds reject before effects\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 2.3037\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Subtest: native Set include fields preserve own __proto__ data without invoking setters or changing output prototypes\nok 54 - native Set include fields preserve own __proto__ data without invoking setters or changing output prototypes\n  ---\n  duration_ms: 0.6315\n  type: 'test'\n  ...\n# Authenticated original node observations: {\"nodeExecutions\":543,\"parameterResolutions\":1280,\"filterExtractions\":528,\"waitMethodExecutions\":0}\n# Original comparison accounting: {\"exactOutputMatches\":459,\"normalizedHttpOutputMatches\":0,\"rejectionOutcomeMatches\":82,\"deliberateDeviations\":2,\"waitMethodOutputMatches\":0}\n1..54\n# tests 54\n# suites 0\n# pass 54\n# fail 0\n# cancelled 0\n# skipped 0\n# todo 0\n# duration_ms 2628.6016\n",
